<p><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/StringToFloat" title="StringToFloat">StringToFloat</a>, <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/FloatToInt" title="FloatToInt">FloatToInt</a>
</p>
